Direct Windows media-session fallback
-------------------------------------
The plugin vendors Python/WinRT 3.2.1 components used to access Windows Global
System Media Transport Controls from the Decky Python runtime when the bundled
MediaBridge helper cannot see the interactive user's media sessions.

